 .opencode/specs path refs in runtime code/tests, confirmed three pre-existing staleness bugs, stated safe-do conditions.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ1\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ1\",\"KQ2\",\"KQ3\",\"KQ4\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Single flat consolidation of all 44 into one level\",\"reason\":\"Zero context win, same migration cost\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-005.md\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:28:00Z\",\"durationMs\":90000}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":5,\"answeredCount\":4,\"totalQuestions\":4,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\"}\nEOF\necho \"appended\"","time":{"start":1786605574730,"end":1786605574732}},"id":"prt_ff9fd942f001tFrTYgkLBpd8Zq","sessionID":"ses_0060d0428ffei56SSM54sNWVN4","messageID":"msg_ff9fd8708001OwyFnxbVsJGuND"}}
