{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786605639748,"sessionID":"ses_0060d0428ffei56SSM54sNWVN4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_ET_mbxhQ08JGRmiK10DZXVL6661","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"openQuestions\": [],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    {\"id\": \"KQ1\", \"text\": \"Is consolidation into fewer larger multi-phase parents feasible and beneficial for context optimization?\", \"answer\": \"Yes — feasible (spec-kit supports arbitrary phase-parent depth); beneficial for dependency-spine groups (010-substrate-and-orchestration, 020-mode-migration-and-cutover), marginal for independent leaves; safe only with timeline-first disciplined migration.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"KQ2\", \"text\": \"Which child folders cluster into which multi-phase parents (by theme/dependency, optimized names)?\", \"answer\": \"7-group shape: 000-foundation-and-planning (001-004), 010-substrate-and-orchestration (005-011), 020-mode-migration-and-cutover (012-015), 030-gate-closeout-and-drift (016-018), 040-runtime-hygiene-and-remediation (019-032), 050-hardening-and-repair (033,035,047-052), 060-review-and-conformance (053-056). Full 44-row mapping in research.md/iteration-003.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"KQ3\", \"text\": \"What is the full migration plan (renames + ALL reference/JSON updates)?\", \"answer\": \"15-surface checklist: parent+child graph-metadata, spec.md phase maps, adjacency lines, description.json, phase-tree.json, validate.sh embedded manifest + recomputed sha256, recursive-child-manifest.vitest.ts, specs/descriptions.json, 98 cross-repo files (both specs/ and .opencode/specs/ spellings), memory re-ingest, handover/docs. Execution order defined.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"KQ4\", \"text\": \"How should timeline.md be designed so chronological lineage survives renumbering?\", \"answer\": \"Append-only table with stable chrono_id (T001...), folder_slug, band, created_at, git_first_add, last_save_at, status, worked_order. Generated from git first-add + graph-metadata before any rename; renames update only slug/band cells.\"}\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    \"44 direct children, in sync with parent children_ids (no orphans)\",\n    \"13 children are already phase parents; 31 are leaves\",\n    \"validate.sh hardcodes a 40-child manifest for 036 with embedded sha256 f6cf1e94... (053-056 missing; passes only due to SPECKIT_CHILD_MANIFEST_FILE gating)\",\n    \"Parent spec.md phase map statuses stale for 053-056\",\n    \"manifest/phase-tree.json covers only 001-017 despite declaring 44 children\",\n    \"98 non-036 files reference 036-deep-loop-innovation, incl. legacy .opencode/specs/ spellings in runtime code/tests\",\n    \"Numbering does not match work order in the 02x-05x range (050 before 019/020; 021 after 022-032)\"\n  ],\n  \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n    {\"approach\": \"Flat 5-group split treating all 44 as equal leaves\", \"reason\": \"13 children already phase parents; remediation wave not a dependency spine\"},\n    {\"approach\": \"Flat renumber with no group parents\", \"reason\": \"No context-optimization gain at equal cost\"},\n    {\"approach\": \"Single flat consolidation of all 44 into one level\", \"reason\": \"Zero benefit, same migration cost\"},\n    {\"approach\": \"Folder number as chronological order\", \"reason\": \"Numbering diverges from work order in 02x-05x\"}\n  ],\n  \"coverageBySources\": {\n    \"on-disk census\": 44,\n    \"git log first-add\": 44,\n    \"child graph-metadata\": 44,\n    \"validate.sh\": 1,\n    \"vitest fixtures\": 1,\n    \"descriptions.json\": 133,\n    \"cross-repo refs\": 98\n  },\n  \"convergenceScore\": 0.81,\n  \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n  \"graphConvergenceScore\": null,\n  \"graphDecision\": null,\n  \"graphBlockers\": [],\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-13T09:30:00Z\"\n}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phas